CREATE TRIGGER specialpricesmovesInsert ON specialpricesmoves FOR INSERT AS DECLARE @MID      INT DECLARE @VSLastId INT SELECT  @MID=ID from Inserted SELECT @VSLastId=LastID from TablesID WHERE TablesID.TableName='specialpricesmoves' IF @MID > @VSLastId BEGIN  RETURN END  Insert Operations (OperationID, OperationType, OperationTable)  SELECT Inserted.ID, 'Insert' AS OperationType , 'specialpricesmoves' AS OperationTable From Inserted 